{"segs": ["PA_ja_131:0.2", "PA_ja_131:0.3"], "en": "First Collection, Chapter on Non-Generosity (Asampadānavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_131:0.4"], "en": "1. The Jātaka of Non-Sharing:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_131:1.1", "PA_ja_131:1.2"], "en": "“Through a lack of sharing with one another, the friendships of the fool turn into strife.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_131:1.3"], "en": "\"Therefore, I shall take away your great pride;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_131:1.4"], "en": "let not our eternal friendship perish.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_131:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the first Jātaka, the Asampadāna Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
